{"book":"2kings","num":11,"verses":[{"en":"And when Athaliah the mother of Ahaziah saw that her son was dead, she arose and destroyed all the seed royal.","n":1,"sm":"Ua iloa e Atalia le tina o Aasaia ua oti lana tama, ona tulai ai lea o ia, ua fasioti i le fanau uma a le tupu.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Atalia"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aasaia"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oti"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"tama,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tulai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fasioti"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fanau"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu."}]},{"en":"But Jehosheba, the daughter of king Joram, sister of Ahaziah, took Joash the son of Ahaziah, and stole him from among the king's sons which were slain; and they hid him, even him and his nurse, in the bedchamber from Athaliah, so that he was not slain.","n":2,"sm":"A e peitai o Iosapa le afafine o le tupu o Ioramo, le tuafafine o Aasaia, na ia ave ia Ioasa le atalii o Aasaia, ua aisola ia te ia i atalii o le tupu e na fasiotia; ua latou na ia te ia, o ia ma le na faasusu ia te ia, i le afeafe moe, ia le iloa e Atalia; ona le fasiotia ai lea o ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"A"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"peitai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Iosapa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"afafine"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioramo,"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tuafafine"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aasaia,"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ave"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioasa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atalii"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Aasaia,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ais